From 18406e89365ae139b600186c20c209192fc565b6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:27:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gi): Remnants of the Origin artifact set

New set (id 15049) with its icons:
- 2-piece: ATK +18%;
- 4-piece: per Starspark (up to 2), CRIT Rate of Cryo DMG +20%, and
  +20% more CRIT Rate for Stellar Glimmer reaction DMG. Only Cryo
  characters deal Cryo Stellar Glimmer DMG, so the Stellar-Conduct and
  Stellar Swirl CRIT Rate only apply to Cryo wielders: up to 40% Cryo
  DMG and 80% Cryo Stellar Glimmer DMG CRIT Rate.

Piece names are placeholders ("Remnants of the Origin: Flower of Life").
Also types the custom character sheet's buff phases strictly.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Asb8vZRqeTYT9zLpVizGNv
